        <h1>Roofing Marketing Strategy: How to Grow a Roofing Business</h1>
        <p class="lf-lede">A successful roofing marketing strategy connects visibility, trust, lead generation and sales follow-up. The objective is not just to attract more inquiries, but to create a reliable pipeline of suitable roofing projects that the business can estimate and fulfill.</p>
