        <strong>THE SHORT ANSWER</strong>
        <p>A successful roofing marketing strategy connects visibility, trust, lead generation and sales follow-up. The objective is not just to attract more inquiries, but to create a reliable pipeline of suitable roofing projects that the business can estimate and fulfill.</p>
      </div>

